  \fill[otCheveuChatain!80!otCheveuBlond] (-0.37,0.1) .. controls (-0.42,0.5) and (-0.1,0.62) .. (0.1,0.55)
    .. controls (0.32,0.54) and (0.42,0.4) .. (0.37,0.1) .. controls (0.33,0.27) and (0.25,0.32) .. (0.12,0.33)
